msgstr "Er ging iets mis."

#: assets/build/admin/index.js:10
msgid "What was done so far is kept. Resume to finish the rest."
msgstr "Wat al gedaan is, blijft bewaard. Hervat om de rest af te maken."

#: assets/build/admin/index.js:10
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Annuleren"

#: assets/build/admin/index.js:10
